Done. `MIGRATION.md` (284 lines) is saved to the workdir. It covers all 6 breaking changes:

| # | Change |
|---|--------|
| 1 | URL prefix `/tasks` → `/v2/tasks` |
| 2 | Auth `X-Auth-Token` → `Authorization: Bearer` |
| 3 | Task ID integer → UUID string |
| 4 | `done` → `completed` |
| 5 | `project_id` required on create |
| 6 | List responses → paginated envelope |

Each change has a before/after code block, an ordered 9-step checklist, and ends with the `pip install --upgrade zrb` command. The migration risk (stale token → 401, missing `project_id` → 422, direct array access → breaks on v2 envelope) is called out per section so readers know exactly what breaks if they miss that step.
